    "title": "WORKFLOW_Builder_Loan Status Retrieval API",
    "description": "The Loan Status Retrieval API allows users to obtain the current status of a specific loan identified by its unique loanId. This functionality is essential for financial institutions, lenders, and customers seeking real-time updates on loan processing stages, approvals, or any pending actions. By calling this endpoint, authorized users can efficiently track loan progress, ensuring transparency and informed decision-making. Typical consumers of this API include customer service representatives and loan processing teams who require accurate status information to assist clients.",
